Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:08:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Spofy subscription-page checkout bridge

Server-to-server router under /cabinet/spofy-subpage (key SPOFY_SUBPAGE_API_KEY):
offer (prices, payment methods, devices, traffic, tariffs for trial users) and
checkout that saves a cart tagged source='spofy_subpage' and creates a top-up for
the full price through the cabinet's own create_topup.

After a top-up, app/services/spofy_subpage_service completes ONLY carts with that
tag, so the global AUTO_PURCHASE_AFTER_TOPUP_ENABLED stays off and no other cart
or plain top-up is ever charged automatically. The user's existing balance is
never spent by the bridge.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
